3. Mushroom & Spinach White Pizza

Creamy & Earthy

Ingredients:

    Pizza dough

    1/2 cup ricotta cheese

    1/2 cup grated mozzarella

    1/2 cup sautéed mushrooms

    Handful fresh spinach

    Garlic, salt & pepper

Instructions:

    Preheat oven to 220°C (430°F).

    Mix ricotta with minced garlic, salt, pepper—spread on dough.

    Add mushrooms, spinach, and mozzarella.

    Bake 12–14 minutes.

    Optional: drizzle with truffle oil. Enjoy!
